{
  "name": "E2E KV Store - Subgroup Queued-Deltas Cold-Start",
  "description": "Regression test for issue #2198: `join_context` deterministic first-attempt failure when a subgroup-owned context has queued gossip deltas.\nReproduces the mero-drive e2e failure shape:\n\n  1. Node-1 (Alice) creates a subgroup and adds node-2 (Bob) to it.\n  2. Node-1 creates a subgroup-owned context.\n  3. Node-1 generates many writes on that context. Each write broadcasts\n     a delta over the context's gossipsub topic.\n  4. Because node-2 is a subgroup member, it receives those gossip deltas\n     into its `delta_store`. Parents are not in node-2's local DB yet\n     (node-2 has never synced the context), so the deltas accumulate as\n     pending.\n  5. Node-2 calls `join_context(subgroup_ctx)`. The fix under test makes\n     this succeed on the FIRST attempt.\n\nPre-fix behaviour (root cause, see docs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-22-join- context-cold-start-design.md):\n  - `delta_store: Some deltas could not be loaded — remaining_count=N\n     loaded_count=0`\n  - `sync::manager: Failed to handle stream message err=context not found:\n     <subgroup-internal-ctx-id>` (an unrelated context leaking onto the\n    sync channel tears down the legitimate sync)\n  - `join_context` returns error ~30ms after the call.\n\nPost-fix behaviour:\n  - Inbound streams for unknown contexts close cleanly without killing\n    the active sync (Fix C).\n  - The sync session pulls missing parents from additional mesh peers\n    within a bounded budget before reporting success, and reports a\n    typed error if it genuinely cannot (Fix B).\n  - Result: `join_context` succeeds deterministically on attempt 1 with\n    a fully-applied DAG; the post-join read sees the last value node-1\n    wrote before join.\n\nWhy this catches the bug that `group-subgroup-cold-sync.yml` misses: that test has node-2 join the context IMMEDIATELY after creation, so node-2's `delta_store` is empty at join time and the queued-deltas race never fires. This workflow specifically delays the join so gossip deltas can accumulate first.\n",
  "comment": [
    "Migrated from this file's v1 workflow by `merobox cloud port`.",
    "Each of the original scenario's nodes is an account here; see merobox/cloud_v2/port.py for the mapping.",
    "Dropped (no counterpart in this node):",
    "  login (unknown) x2: checks what the dropped steps did",
    "  wait_for_sync x1: replication is synchronous: a read sees every committed write"
  ],
  "cluster": {
    "nodes": 3
  },
  "accounts": [
    "e2e-node-1",
    "e2e-node-2"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "Install application on node-1",
      "type": "upload_bundle",
      "wasm": "{{env.CORE_WASM_DIR}}/scaffolding_e2e.wasm",
      "outputs": {
        "app_id_bundle": "hash"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "set",
      "values": {
        "app_id": "com.calimero.scaffolding-e2e"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Create namespace on node-1",
      "type": "create_org",
      "org_name": "Create namespace on node-1",
      "outputs": {
        "namespace_id": "orgId"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Create namespace invitation for node-2",
      "type": "invite",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "role": "member",
      "account": "e2e-node-1",
      "outputs": {
        "namespace_invitation": "token"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Node-2 joins namespace",
      "type": "redeem_invite",
      "token": "{{namespace_invitation}}",
      "account": "e2e-node-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "whoami",
      "account": "e2e-node-2",
      "outputs": {
        "member_identity_node2": "publicKey"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Create subgroup inside namespace",
      "type": "create_team",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team_name": "queued-deltas-subgroup",
      "join": "invite",
      "outputs": {
        "subgroup_id": "teamId"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Add node-2 to subgroup",
      "type": "team_add",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{subgroup_id}}",
      "members": [
        "{{member_identity_node2}}"
      ],
      "role": "member",
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Node-2 lists subgroup members (local view)",
      "type": "team_get",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{subgroup_id}}",
      "account": "e2e-node-2",
      "outputs": {
        "node2_view_of_subgroup_members": "members"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert node-2's local group_store knows about the subgroup",
      "type": "assert",
      "statements": [
        "is_set({{node2_view_of_subgroup_members}})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Node-1 lists subgroup members (authoritative view)",
      "type": "team_get",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{subgroup_id}}",
      "account": "e2e-node-1",
      "outputs": {
        "node1_view_of_subgroup_members": "members"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert node-1 also knows about the subgroup",
      "type": "assert",
      "statements": [
        "is_set({{node1_view_of_subgroup_members}})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Create context inside subgroup (node-1 only)",
      "type": "deploy",
      "account": "e2e-node-1",
      "wasm": "{{env.CORE_WASM_DIR}}/scaffolding_e2e.wasm",
      "app_name": "Create context inside subgroup (node-1 only)",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "access": {
        "kind": "team",
        "team": "{{subgroup_id}}"
      },
      "outputs": {
        "sub_ctx_id": "contextId"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 01",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k01",
        "value": "v01"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 02",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k02",
        "value": "v02"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 03",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k03",
        "value": "v03"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 04",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k04",
        "value": "v04"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 05",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k05",
        "value": "v05"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 06",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k06",
        "value": "v06"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 07",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k07",
        "value": "v07"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 08",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k08",
        "value": "v08"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 09",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k09",
        "value": "v09"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 10",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k10",
        "value": "v10"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 11",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k11",
        "value": "v11"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 12",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k12",
        "value": "v12"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 13",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k13",
        "value": "v13"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 14",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k14",
        "value": "v14"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 15",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k15",
        "value": "v15"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 16",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k16",
        "value": "v16"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 17",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k17",
        "value": "v17"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 18",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k18",
        "value": "v18"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 19",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "k19",
        "value": "v19"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Alice delta 20 (the sentinel the join_context read will check)",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set",
      "args": {
        "key": "sentinel",
        "value": "queued_delta_20"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Wait for gossip deltas to accumulate in node-2's delta_store",
      "type": "wait",
      "seconds": 10.0,
      "message": "queued gossip deltas must be present before join_context"
    },
    {
      "name": "Node-2 reads the sentinel key",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{sub_ctx_id}}",
      "method": "get",
      "args": {
        "key": "sentinel"
      },
      "account": "e2e-node-2",
      "outputs": {
        "sentinel_read": "rpc"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert node-2 sees the final pre-join write",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "json_equal({{sentinel_read}}, {\"output\": \"queued_delta_20\"})"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
